a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追补姚元白市隐园十八咏 其十三 秋影亭","author":"王世贞","text":"秋树影扶苏，斜阳半亭挂。\n似延李营丘，写得寒林画。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42649,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追补姚元白市隐园十八咏 其十四 浮玉桥","author":"王世贞","text":"水面蜿蜒虹，乃是坚牢玉。\n我欲访蓬莱，鼋鼍不须属。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42650,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追补姚元白市隐园十八咏 其十五 芙蓉馆","author":"王世贞","text":"水木两芙蓉，为媚非一时。\n客爱承露色，我爱凌云姿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42651,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追补姚元白市隐园十八咏 其十六 鹤径","author":"王世贞","text":"藩竹别成径，小欲观步鹤。\n何似养翮成，高秋纵天路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42652,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追补姚元白市隐园十八咏 其十七 萃止居","author":"王世贞","text":"客从何方来，来复不肯去。\n为贪主人佳，尽作王猷趣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42653,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追补姚元白市隐园十八咏 其十八 借暝庵","author":"王世贞","text":"暝色何可爱，为辞白日嚣。\n非同倦飞鸟，大小归其巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac8589789