树树鸭头绿，溪溪鱼鳞白。\n欲觅酒家胡，云深断行迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张复画二十绝 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"千岩去不尽，一瀑断还连。\n踟蹰不忍别，且伴鹿麑眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张复画二十绝 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"科头长松下，垂钓清波里。\n借问渔者谁，不语亦不起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42663,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张复画二十绝 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"中天插怪石，半壁界飞湍。\n欲识溪桥路，前林枫叶丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42664,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题张复画二十绝 其七","author":"王世贞","text":"白云封不住，碧树吐奇滋。\n相看两无语，各是会心时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42665,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]